exports[`magicLinkEmail > renders the same text and HTML as last time 1`] = `
"PartnerStandard Desk

Hi Lena Ortiz,

Anna Keller shared the mutual action plan for Brightwave Systems with you. You can see the whole plan and update the activities and objectives on your side. No account needed.

Open the plan https://map.test/c/abc

This link is just for you: anyone with it can edit your side of the plan, so please don’t forward it. It stops working after 90 days without use; you can then ask for a new one.

----------------------------------------

Sent by PartnerStandard Desk for Anna Keller. Reply to this email to reach them."
`;

